# Repo-only docs at source root. Patterns match DESTINATION names.
# ./ anchors these patterns to $HOME/AGENTS.md and $HOME/README.md without
# confusing them with nested files such as .codex/AGENTS.md. Leading slash
# patterns are rejected by chezmoi v2.72.2 on Termux.
# ./AGENTS.md stays in git for Pi/Codex in this repo; it is not deployed.
# Pi-global instructions are dot_pi/agent/literal_AGENTS.md.tmpl -> ~/.pi/agent/AGENTS.md.
# Do not add a source that deploys to ~/AGENTS.md: same target as this file,
# chezmoi reports inconsistent state.
# ./README.md is the product README; do not also land it at ~/README.md.
